	(text "NC contacts in series between 1 and 2 (DAB: coolant-flow switch + cold-plate thermostat), wetted from\n24V_OR through 2.2k into an ISO1211 type 1/3 input on GND: 2.05-2.75 mA (current-limited), +/-60 V\ntolerant, open = trip; short to GND = 11 mA. Fit a wire link when unused. TRIP_TEST shorts the input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 370.844 78.92 0)
